- Hints: parallax and side-pan "Best on images and text. On a coloured band, Strong can show a gap at its edges."; pin-reveal "Adds extra scrolling while it is held."; sticky-stack "Use it on two or more elements in a row. Each needs its own background."; always: "Visitors who turn off motion on their device see it still." and "The servd app shows a simple entrance instead."
